(1) Submission comments do NOT count. If all I receive are submission comme=
nts, I will grade the latest submission received before the deadline.

(2) If all that is received before the due deadline is the top-sheet, then =
the grade will be a 0.

(3) To repeat, I will grade something submitted during the grace period, th=
at is, between the due deadline and the availability deadline only if I am =
notified that this is the document intended for being graded and only if th=
e changes are merely cosmetic changes and only if I am sent the list by ema=
il within CANVAS.

(4) CANVAS provides me a list of Late Submissions, that is, submissions mad=
e during the grace period, along with names.

(5) CANVAS puts a TIME-STAMP on every submission; there is, therefore, no r=
oom for disagreement.

(6) I start grading once the availability deadline passes, after I receive =
a list of all late submissions from CANVAS.

